oxide-explorer (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Phase 4 release
  * Tabbed browsing with per-tab state
  * Dual-pane Commander-style mode (F3)
  * Embedded VTE terminal (F4)
  * Miller columns Finder-style view (F5)
  * Lua plugin system
  * Network drive support (SMB, FTP, SFTP, WebDAV)
  * Advanced search with regex and content search
  * Batch file renamer
  * Preview pane with text/image support
  * Archive management (extract/compress)
  * File tagging and color dots via xattr
  * Cloud sync status detection
  * Vim-style keybindings
  * Customizable keyboard shortcuts
  * Drag and drop file operations
  * Bookmarks with persistence
  * 30+ keyboard shortcuts

